1	<!DOCTYPE html>
2	<html lang="zh-Hant">
3	<head>
4	<meta charset="UTF-8">
5	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
6	<title>結繩領導學｜現場座談會 × 實體工作坊</title>
7	<style>
8	:root {
9	  --blue: #123a63;
10	  --blue-deep: #0b2742;
11	  --blue-mid: #174873;
12	  --orange: #f28c28;
13	  --orange-soft: #ffb25b;
14	  --bg: #f4f7fb;
15	  --text: #1d2a35;
16	  --muted: #5f6b76;
17	  --white: #ffffff;
18	  --radius: 18px;
19	  --radius-lg: 26px;
20	}
21	* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
22	html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
23	body { font-family: "Noto Sans TC","Microsoft JhengHei",sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.7; }
24	img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
25	.container { width: min(1100px, calc(100% - 32px)); margin: 0 auto; }
26	section { padding: 64px 0; }
27	.section-title { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--blue-deep); margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.3; }
28	.section-desc { color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; max-width: 720px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
29	
30	/* ── HERO ── */
31	.hero {
32	  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue-deep), var(--blue));
33	  color: #fff;
34	  padding: 72px 0 60px;
35	  position: relative;
36	  overflow: hidden;
37	}
38	.hero::before {
39	  content:""; position:absolute; width:360px; height:360px; right:-80px; top:-80px;
40	  border-radius:50%; background:rgba(242,140,40,.14); filter:blur(12px); pointer-events:none;
41	}
42	.hero::after {
43	  content:""; position:absolute; width:200px; height:200px; left:-60px; bottom:-60px;
44	  border-radius:50%; background:rgba(255,255,255,.05); filter:blur(8px); pointer-events:none;
45	}
46	.hero-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.15fr 0.85fr; gap:44px; align-items:center; }
47	.eyebrow {
48	  display:inline-block; background:rgba(255,255,255,.1); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
49	  color:rgba(255,255,255,.95); padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px; font-size:13px; margin-bottom:16px;
50	}
51	h1 { font-size:48px; line-height:1.13; font-weight:900; margin-bottom:16px; }
52	.hero-sub { font-size:18px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.88); margin-bottom:28px; max-width:560px; }
53	.btn {
54	  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; padding:14px 24px; border-radius:999px;
55	  text-decoration:none; font-weight:900; font-size:15px; transition:.25s ease; border:none; cursor:pointer;
56	}
57	.btn-primary { background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--orange),#ff9e3d); color:#fff; box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(242,140,40,.35); }
58	.btn-expired { background:var(--muted); color:#fff; box-shadow:none; opacity:.6; cursor:not-allowed; }
59	.btn-expired:hover { background:var(--muted); box-shadow:none; transform:none; }
60	.btn-danger { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d33b3b,#b91c1c); color:#fff; box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(185,28,28,.28); }
61	.btn-danger:hover { transform:translateY(-2px); }
62	.member-note { display:inline-block; margin-top:8px; padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; font-size:12px; font-weight:800; color:#b91c1c; background:rgba(185,28,28,.08); border:1px solid rgba(185,28,28,.16); }
63	.modal-overlay { position:fixed; inset:0; background:rgba(11,39,66,.62); display:none; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:20px; z-index:9999; }
64	.modal-overlay.active { display:flex; }
65	.modal-box { width:min(460px, 100%); background:#fff; border-radius:22px; padding:28px 24px; box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.22); text-align:center; }
66	.modal-box h3 { color:var(--blue-deep); font-size:24px; font-weight:900; margin-bottom:10px; }
67	.modal-box p { color:var(--muted); font-size:15px; line-height:1.8; margin-bottom:18px; }
68	.modal-actions { display:flex; gap:12px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; }
69	.modal-actions .btn { min-width:140px; }
70	body.modal-open { overflow:hidden; }
71	@media(max-width:768px){ .modal-actions .btn { width:100%; } }
72	.btn-secondary { color:#fff; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28); background:rgba(255,255,255,.07); }
73	.btn:hover { transform:translateY(-2px); }
74	.btn-secondary:hover { background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--orange),#ff9e3d); border-color:transparent; color:#fff; box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(242,140,40,.35); }
75	.btn-primary:hover { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff9e3d,var(--orange)); box-shadow:0 16px 32px rgba(242,140,40,.45); }
76	.cta-row { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; }
77	.hero-note { margin-top:12px; font-size:13px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.7); }
78	
79	/* Book card */
80	@keyframes float {
81	  0%,100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
82	  50%      { transform: translateY(-18px); }
83	}
84	.book-card {
85	  background:transparent; border:none; padding:0;
86	  position:relative; overflow:visible;
87	}
88	.book-img-wrap {
89	  display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center;
90	}
91	.book-img {
92	  width:100%; max-width:100%; border-radius:0;
93	  filter: drop-shadow(0 40px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.6)) drop-shadow(0 8px 24px rgba(242,140,40,.22));
94	  animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
95	  transition: filter .35s ease, transform .35s ease;
96	  cursor: pointer;
97	}
98	.book-img:hover {
99	  animation-play-state: paused;
100	  transform: scale(1.04) translateY(-8px);
101	  filter: drop-shadow(0 55px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.7)) drop-shadow(0 12px 32px rgba(242,140,40,.35));
102	}
103	
104	/* Cards */
105	.cards3 { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:18px; }
106	.card {
107	  background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--blue-deep),var(--blue-mid)); border-radius:var(--radius);
108	  padding:26px; color:#fff; position:relative; overflow:hidden;
109	}
110	.card::before {
111	  content:""; position:absolute; width:120px; height:120px; right:-40px; top:-40px;
112	  border-radius:50%; background:rgba(242,140,40,.15); pointer-events:none;
113	}
114	.card h3 { color:var(--orange-soft); font-size:20px; font-weight:900; margin-bottom:10px; line-height:1.35; }
115	.card p { color:rgba(255,255,255,.9); font-size:14px; }
116	
117	/* Highlight box */
118	.highlight {
119	  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fff8f0); border:1px solid rgba(242,140,40,.2);
120	  border-radius:var(--radius); padding:28px; font-size:16px; line-height:1.85;
121	}
122	
123	/* Pain section */
124	.white-bg { background:#fff; }
125	
126	/* Chapter cards */
127	.cards4 { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:18px; }
128	.chapter-card {
129	  background:#fff; border:1px solid rgba(18,58,99,.1); border-radius:var(--radius);
130	  padding:24px; display:flex; gap:16px; align-items:flex-start;
131	}
132	.chapter-num {
133	  flex-shrink:0; width:42px; height:42px; border-radius:50%;
134	  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--orange),#ff9e3d);
135	  color:#fff; font-weight:900; font-size:18px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
136	}
137	.chapter-card h3 { font-size:17px; font-weight:900; color:var(--blue-deep); margin-bottom:6px; }
138	.chapter-card p { font-size:14px; color:var(--muted); }
139	
140	/* Split */
141	.split2 { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:28px; }
142	
143	/* Quote */
144	.quote {
145	  border-left:4px solid var(--orange); padding:22px 26px;
146	  background:#fff; border-radius:0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
147	  font-size:16px; font-style:italic; color:var(--text); line-height:1.85;
148	}
149	
150	/* Teacher */
151	.teacher-wrap { position:relative; }
152	.teacher-img-card {
153	  border-radius:var(--radius-lg); overflow:hidden;
154	  box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.22); position:relative;
155	}
156	.teacher-img-card img {
157	  width:100%; display:block; border-radius:var(--radius-lg);
158	}
159	.teacher-badge {
160	  position:absolute; bottom:20px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%);
161	  background:rgba(11,39,66,.85); backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
162	  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15); border-radius:12px;
163	  padding:14px 22px; color:#fff; text-align:center; white-space:nowrap;
164	}
165	.teacher-badge strong { display:block; font-size:17px; font-weight:900; }
166	.teacher-badge span { font-size:12px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.7); }
167	.tag {
168	  display:inline-block; background:rgba(242,140,40,.12); border:1px solid rgba(242,140,40,.28);
169	  color:#c06010; border-radius:999px; padding:5px 12px; font-size:13px; margin:4px 4px 0 0;
170	}
171	
172	/* Events */
173	.events-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:16px; }
174	.event-card {
175	  background:#fff; border:1px solid rgba(18,58,99,.1); border-radius:var(--radius);
176	  padding:22px; text-align:center; transition:.2s;
177	}
178	.event-card:hover { box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(18,58,99,.1); transform:translateY(-2px); }
179	.event-card h3 { font-size:17px; font-weight:900; color:var(--blue-deep); margin-bottom:6px; }
180	.event-time { color:var(--muted); font-size:14px; margin-bottom:6px; }
181	.event-count { font-size:13px; color:var(--orange); font-weight:700; margin-bottom:14px; min-height:20px; }
182	.event-limit { font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:14px; }
183	.notice-bar {
184	  background:rgba(242,140,40,.1); border:1px solid rgba(242,140,40,.28);
185	  border-radius:12px; padding:14px 18px; font-size:14px; margin-bottom:24px; color:var(--text);
186	}
187	
188	/* Form */
189	.form-card { background:#fff; border-radius:var(--radius-lg); padding:32px; border:1px solid rgba(18,58,99,.1); }
190	.form-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px; }
191	.form-grid input, .form-grid select, .form-grid textarea {
192	  padding:12px 16px; border:1.5px solid #dce4ed; border-radius:10px;
193	  font-size:15px; font-family:inherit; color:var(--text); background:#f9fbfd; transition:.2s;
194	  width:100%;
195	}
196	.form-grid input:focus, .form-grid select:focus, .form-grid textarea:focus {
197	  outline:none; border-color:var(--orange);
198	}
199	.form-grid .full { grid-column:1/-1; }
200	.form-note { font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); margin-top:12px; }
201	
202	/* FAQ */
203	.faq details { border-bottom:1px solid rgba(18,58,99,.1); padding:16px 0; }
204	.faq summary {
205	  font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; font-size:16px; color:var(--blue-deep);
206	  list-style:none; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
207	}
208	.faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display:none; }
209	.faq summary::before { content:"▶"; font-size:11px; color:var(--orange); transition:.2s; flex-shrink:0; }
210	.faq details[open] summary::before { transform:rotate(90deg); }
211	.faq details p { padding:10px 0 2px 22px; color:var(--muted); font-size:15px; }
212	
213	/* Footer */
214	footer { background:var(--blue-deep); color:rgba(255,255,255,.7); text-align:center; padding:28px 16px; font-size:14px; }
215	
216	/* ── Floating Nav ── */
217	.float-nav {
218	  position:fixed; right:18px; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%);
219	  display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; z-index:9000;
220	  opacity:0; pointer-events:none; transition:opacity .3s;
221	}
222	.float-nav.visible { opacity:1; pointer-events:auto; }
223	.float-nav a {
224	  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
225	  width:48px; height:48px; border-radius:50%;
226	  background:rgba(11,39,66,.88); backdrop-filter:blur(8px);
227	  color:#fff; text-decoration:none; font-size:13px; font-weight:900;
228	  box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.22); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
229	  transition:.25s ease; position:relative;
230	}
231	.float-nav a:hover { background:var(--orange); transform:scale(1.1); }
232	.float-nav a .nav-tooltip {
233	  position:absolute; right:58px; white-space:nowrap;
234	  background:rgba(11,39,66,.92); color:#fff; padding:6px 12px;
235	  border-radius:8px; font-size:12px; font-weight:700;
236	  opacity:0; pointer-events:none; transition:opacity .2s;
237	}
238	.float-nav a:hover .nav-tooltip { opacity:1; }
239	
240	@media(max-width:768px){
241	  .hero-grid,.cards3,.cards4,.split2,.events-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
242	  .form-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
243	  h1 { font-size:34px; }
244	  .section-title { font-size:24px; }
245	  .hero { padding:52px 0 44px; }
246	  .float-nav { right:12px; }
247	  .float-nav a { width:42px; height:42px; font-size:12px; }
248	  .float-nav a .nav-tooltip { display:none; }
249	}
250	</style>
251	</head>
252	<body>
253	
254	<!-- ★ HERO -->
255	<section class="hero">
256	  <div class="container">
257	    <div class="hero-grid">
258	      <div>
259	        <span class="eyebrow">📖 2026 年度重磅新書</span>
260	        <h1>結繩領導學<br>現場座談會 × 實體工作坊</h1>
261	        <p class="hero-sub">
262	          你不是不努力，你是少了一套結構。<br>
263	          一位總工程師教你用理工思維，打造不倒的事業大樓。
264	        </p>
265	        <div class="cta-row">
266	          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#events">立即報名活動</a>
267	          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#book-intro">瞭解這本書</a>
268	          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#workshop">瞭解工作坊</a>
269	        </div>
270	        <p class="hero-note">📍 線上座談會 10場 ‧ 晚上不同時段 ‧ 免費線上報名</p>
271	      </div>
272	      <div>
273	        <div class="book-card">
274	          <div class="book-img-wrap">
275	            <img src="book.png" alt="結繩領導學封面" class="book-img">
276	          </div>
277	        </div>
278	      </div>
279	    </div>
280	  </div>
281	</section>
282	
283	<!-- ★ 這本書是寫給誰 -->
284	<section id="who" class="white-bg">
285	  <div class="container">
286	    <h2 class="section-title">這本書是寫給你的，如果你……</h2>
287	    <p class="section-desc">看起來很忙、很努力，但問題從來不在努力，而在結構設計。</p>
288	    <div class="cards3">
289	      <div class="card">
290	        <h3>業務與公關型老闆</h3>
291	        <p>奔波各種商務活動、交換很多名片，卻始終沒有形成穩定合作網絡。看似熱絡，其實鬆散；看似有資源，其實沒有真正的結構支撐。</p>
292	      </div>
293	      <div class="card">
294	        <h3>擴張期企業主</h3>
295	        <p>你在衝業績、衝規模、衝人數，但地基沒有同步補強。很多企業不是敗給市場，而是敗給內部承載不了成長的重量。</p>
296	      </div>
297	      <div class="card">
298	        <h3>帶人帶到心累的主管</h3>
299	        <p>你把責任扛在肩上，用力盯數字、盯進度、盯規矩，換來的卻是夥伴表面配合、私下敷衍。你像一根單樁，越撐越累。</p>
300	      </div>
301	    </div>
302	  </div>
303	</section>
304	
305	<!-- ★ 書在解決什麼 -->
306	<section id="book-intro">
307	  <div class="container">
308	    <h2 class="section-title">這不是心靈雞湯，而是一份企業家的結構安全計算書</h2>
309	    <p class="section-desc">領導不是玄學，而是力學。不是靠天分，也不是只靠情緒，而是一套可理解、可拆解、可驗證、可落地的系統設計。</p>
310	    <div class="highlight">
311	      在你下一次擴張、招募、再加蓋事業版圖之前，先停下來做一次結構健檢。<br><br>
312	      看懂團隊的<strong>承載力、連結密度與情緒阻尼器</strong>，才能讓成長不只是撐住，而是真正長久地撐得住。
313	    </div>
314	  </div>
315	</section>
316	
317	<!-- ★ 書的四大核心 -->
318	<section class="white-bg">
319	  <div class="container">
320	    <h2 class="section-title">書中的四大工具搶先看</h2>
321	    <p class="section-desc">不是讀完覺得有道理，而是看完就能開始重新設計你的團隊結構。</p>
322	    <div class="cards4">
323	      <div class="chapter-card">
324	        <div class="chapter-num">1</div>
325	        <div>
326	          <h3>靜力學｜信任與價值的地基</h3>
327	          <p>建立團隊真正可依賴的底層價值，重新理解規範與自由的平衡，讓組織不再靠情緒運作，而是靠信任承載。</p>
328	        </div>
329	      </div>
330	      <div class="chapter-card">
331	        <div class="chapter-num">2</div>
332	        <div>
333	          <h3>材料力學｜極限環境下的識人術</h3>
334	          <p>常溫常壓下看不出材質，一到壓力情境才見真章。學會辨識可塑之才、適配之才，將對的人放在對的位置。</p>
335	        </div>
336	      </div>
337	      <div class="chapter-card">
338	        <div class="chapter-num">3</div>
339	        <div>
340	          <h3>結構與抗壓｜危機中的情緒阻尼器</h3>
341	          <p>市場有風雨，團隊更需要能吸收衝擊的系統。避免把外部壓力變成內部傷害，讓危機變成升級動能。</p>
342	        </div>
343	      </div>
344	      <div class="chapter-card">
345	        <div class="chapter-num">4</div>
346	        <div>
347	          <h3>美學與色彩｜編織溫暖的人脈網</h3>
348	          <p>放下冷硬磚塊式管理，用傘繩思維打造緊而不死、鬆而不散的關係，把差異編成圖騰，把連結變成力量。</p>
349	        </div>
350	      </div>
351	    </div>
352	  </div>
353	</section>
354	
355	<!-- ★ 作者介紹 -->
356	<section>
357	  <div class="container">
358	    <div class="split2" style="align-items:center;">
359	      <div>
360	        <h2 class="section-title">你的總工程師與結繩引路人</h2>
361	        <p style="font-size:20px; font-weight:900; color:var(--blue-deep); margin-bottom:6px;">蔡曜隆 Richard Tsai（曜董）</p>
362	        <p class="section-desc">40年工程經驗+50年結繩智慧+10年國家級商務整合。走過理性與感性的兩端，也走過結構與人性的交界。</p>
363	        <div style="margin-bottom:18px;">
364	          <span class="tag">理智腦</span>
365	          <span class="tag">藝術心</span>
366	          <span class="tag">剛柔並濟</span>
367	        </div>
368	        <div class="highlight">
369	          他帶領你重新理解：真正成熟的領導，不只是會管理，而是能同時做到——<br><br>
370	          <strong>心中有尺</strong>（價值觀）<br>
371	          <strong>手中有線</strong>（人脈鏈結）<br>
372	          <strong>眼裡有光</strong>（愛與關懷）
373	        </div>
374	      </div>
375	      <div class="teacher-wrap">
376	        <div class="teacher-img-card">
377	          <img src="teacher.jpg" alt="蔡曜隆 Richard Tsai">
378	          <div class="teacher-badge">
379	            <strong>蔡曜隆 Richard Tsai</strong>
380	            <span>《結繩領導學》作者</span>
381	          </div>
382	        </div>
383	      </div>
384	    </div>
385	  </div>
386	</section>
387	
388	<!-- ★ Before / After -->
389	<section class="white-bg">
